# What the GPU image must not carry.
#
# Without this, COPY . /app pulled every local environment, the 10 GB checkpoint
# and the logs into the image: slow to build, huge to push, and on Windows it even
# copied .venv\Scripts, which cannot work inside the container. The image installs
# its own environment and downloads the weights at first run instead.
.venv
**/.venv
song_service/models
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
build
logs
**/logs
*.log
.git
.gitignore
tools/node
downloader_service/data
node_modules
*.egg-info
__pycache__
